msgstr "重启服务"

msgid "No RPM sensor detected, value is estimated. Please verify manually."
msgstr "未检测到转速传感器，数值为估算值，请手动确认。"

msgid "Start Calibration"
msgstr "开始校准"

msgid "Calibration started"
msgstr "校准已启动"

msgid "Measured (verified)"
msgstr "实测（已验证）"

msgid "Estimated (no RPM sensor)"
msgstr "估算（无转速传感器）"

msgid "Unknown / Manual"
msgstr "未知 / 手动"

msgid "Calibration Source"
msgstr "校准来源"

msgid "Calibration Time"
msgstr "校准时间"

msgid "Config reload failed: "
msgstr "配置重载失败："

msgid "unknown error"
msgstr "未知错误"

msgid ", please check system logs"
msgstr "，请检查系统日志"

msgid "Calibration complete: start threshold %s%% (PWM: %s) [Measured]"
msgstr "校准完成：启动阈值 %s%%（PWM：%s）[实测]"

msgid "Calibration complete: start threshold %s%% (PWM: %s) [Estimated]"
msgstr "校准完成：启动阈值 %s%%（PWM：%s）[估算]"

msgid "Calibration failed: fan not spinning (RPM sensor no response)"
msgstr "校准失败：风扇未转动（转速传感器无响应）"

msgid "Please check fan connection or set threshold manually."
msgstr "请检查风扇连接或手动设置阈值。"

msgid "Verified with RPM feedback"
msgstr "已验证转速反馈"

msgid "Stable RPM: %s"
msgstr "稳定转速：%s"

msgid "Peak: %s"
msgstr "峰值：%s"

msgid "Reloads: %s"
msgstr "配置重载：%s"

msgid "Service running"
msgstr "服务运行中"

msgid "Service stopped"
msgstr "服务已停止"

msgid "Stop the service before calibration"
msgstr "请先停止服务再校准"

msgid "Loading…"
msgstr "加载中…"

msgid "Status and Control"
msgstr "状态与控制"

msgid "Control Curve"
msgstr "控制曲线"

msgid "Temperature / Fan Speed Curve"
msgstr "温度-转速曲线"

msgid "Temperature Range"
msgstr "温度范围"

msgid "Speed Range"
msgstr "转速范围"

msgid "Operating Point"
msgstr "当前工作点"

msgid "Fan Start Threshold Calibration"
msgstr "风扇启动阈值校准"

msgid "Detects the lowest PWM value that reliably starts the fan and stores it in the configuration. The service must be stopped."
msgstr "自动测定风扇可靠启动所需的最低 PWM 值并写入配置；校准前需要先停止服务。"

msgid "No RPM data (no sensor, or not sampled yet)"
msgstr "暂无转速数据（无转速传感器，或尚未采集到样本）"

msgid "Power"
msgstr "功率"

msgid "Minimum RPM"
msgstr "最低转速"

msgid "Power → Minimum RPM"
msgstr "功率 → 最低转速"

msgid "Lowest RPM observed per power step since the service started."
msgstr "服务启动以来，各功率档位观测到的最低转速。"

msgid "Mode applied: %s"
msgstr "已套用模式：%s"

msgid "Current mode: %s"
msgstr "当前模式：%s"

msgid "Custom curve in use"
msgstr "正在使用自定义曲线"

msgid "Fan Mode"
msgstr "风扇模式"

msgid "Curve updated in the form — click “Save & Apply” to activate it."
msgstr "曲线已更新到表单，点击「保存并应用」后生效。"

msgid "The chart shows the curve of the current control mode; the red dot marks the live operating point. Drag the two round handles to adjust the temperature range and fan speed, then save to apply."
msgstr "图表显示当前控制模式的曲线，红点为实时工作点；拖动两端圆点可调整温度区间与转速，保存后生效。"

msgid "Ramp Up Time (s)"
msgstr "升速时间（秒）"

msgid "Shortest time to go from minimum to maximum speed; 0 disables the limit."
msgstr "从最低转速升到最高转速所需的最短秒数；0 表示不限制。"

msgid "Ramp Down Time (s)"
msgstr "降速时间（秒）"

msgid "Shortest time to go from maximum to minimum speed; 0 disables the limit."
msgstr "从最高转速降到最低转速所需的最短秒数；0 表示不限制。"

msgid "Temperature sources (highest wins): "
msgstr "测温点（取最高）："

msgid "Temperature Sources"
msgstr "测温点"

msgid "Up to 3 sources; the highest reading drives the fan."
msgstr "最多选 3 个测温点，取其中最高温参与调速。"

msgid "Extreme Quiet"
msgstr "极致静音"

msgid "Lowers fan speed by 15% to reduce noise, never below the calibrated start threshold."
msgstr "在曲线基础上下调 15% 转速以降噪，且不会低于校准得到的最低可用转速。"

msgid "Requires a completed fan calibration first."
msgstr "需要先完成风扇校准。"

msgid "Auto Fan Stop"
msgstr "自动停转"

msgid "Stops the fan when the target speed falls below the calibrated start threshold."
msgstr "当目标转速低于校准得到的最低可用转速时让风扇停转。"

msgid "Requires Extreme Quiet and a completed calibration."
msgstr "需要先开启极致静音并完成校准。"

msgid "Fixed speed mode: drag the handle up or down to set the fan speed, then save to apply."
msgstr "固定转速模式：上下拖动圆点即可设定风扇转速，保存后生效。"

msgid "No log lines match the filter."
msgstr "没有符合过滤条件的日志。"

msgid "No FanXpert log entries yet."
msgstr "还没有 FanXpert 日志。"

msgid "The daemon only logs at or above the configured level (currently %s)."
msgstr "守护进程只记录不低于当前日志级别（%s）的事件。"

msgid "%d entries"
msgstr "%d 条"

msgid "No entries"
msgstr "暂无日志"

msgid "Log level: %s"
msgstr "日志级别：%s"

msgid "Lines"
msgstr "行数"

msgid "Filter"
msgstr "过滤"

msgid "Search text"
msgstr "搜索内容"

msgid "Auto refresh"
msgstr "自动刷新"

msgid "Refresh"
msgstr "刷新"

msgid "Copy"
msgstr "复制"

msgid "FanXpert Logs"
msgstr "FanXpert 日志"

msgid "Recent daemon log entries from the system log (tag FANXPERT)."
msgstr "来自系统日志的守护进程日志（tag FANXPERT）。"

msgid "Logs"
msgstr "日志"

msgid "Configuration saved; the daemon reloaded it."
msgstr "配置已保存，守护进程已重新加载。"

msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

msgid "Fan curve, temperature sources and advanced fan options."
msgstr "风扇曲线、测温点与高级选项。"

msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概览"

